  "ruleText": "Res 1104.02 Documentation. All petitions shall document occurrences of species by herbarium specimens or good quality photographs.\n\nSource. #5927, eff 11-22-94, EXPIRED: 11-22-00\n\nNew. #7507, eff 6-21-01; ss by #9479, eff 6-1-09, EXPIRED: 6-1-17",
